<title>USA: Puget Sound, Washington merged.</title>
<headline>Puget Sound, Washington merged.</headline>
<dateline>BELLEVUE, Wash. 1997-02-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Puget Sound Power &amp; Light Co and Washington Energy Co on Friday said they expected to begin combined operations next week after their boards of directors gave final approval to their merger.</p>
<p>The combined company, which is to be known as Puget Sound Energy Inc, will be the largest combined electric and gas utility in the Northwest part of the United States, it said</p>
<p>The merger was first announced in October 1995.</p>
<p>Public trading of the new company's stock is to begin on February 11 under the symbol,.</p>
</text>
